cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Boreas-RT SLAM Benchmark
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, its harness or its measurements, please cite it.
  Cite the Boreas-RT dataset separately -- see `references` below; its CC BY 4.0
  licence requires attribution.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Sibel Turgut
    website: https://leodrive.ai
repository-code: https://github.com/REPLACE-ME/boreas-rt-slam-benchmark
abstract: >-
  Eight open-source LiDAR SLAM, odometry and map-based localization systems
  measured on five sequences of the Boreas-RT dataset (51.9 km) on identical
  hardware with identical preprocessing, three runs each. This repository is
  the harness, the parameter changes applied to each upstream system, and the
  scoring code needed to regenerate every published number from the dataset up.
keywords:
  - SLAM
  - LiDAR
  - odometry
  - localization
  - benchmark
  - ROS
license: Apache-2.0
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Boreas Road Trip: A Multi-Sensor Autonomous Driving Dataset on
      Challenging Roads
    authors:
      - family-names: Lisus
        given-names: Daniil
      - family-names: Papais
        given-names: Katya M.
      - family-names: Le Gentil
        given-names: Cedric
      - family-names: Preston-Krebs
        given-names: Elliot
      - family-names: Lambert
        given-names: Andrew
      - family-names: Leung
        given-names: Keith Y. K.
      - family-names: Barfoot
        given-names: Timothy D.
    year: 2026
    identifiers:
      - type: other
        value: arXiv:2602.16870
